  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Slice the bread into 1-inch thick slices.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the smoked paprika, olive oil, garlic, salt, and chopped onion.",
    "Brush the mixture onto each bread slice.",
    "Top each bread slice with crumbled feta cheese and chopped parsley.",
    "Place the bread slices on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Bake for 10-12 minutes or until the bread is golden brown and the cheese is melted.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
